  "scope": "Narrow mzML and FileHandler routes for the early TOPP bundle: spectrum-level MS:1001581 and scan-level MS:1002476/MS:1002815/MS:1001581/MS:1002954 on the reader and scan writer, the MS:1000525 representation reset, unit_accession on ion-mobility data arrays, FileHandler::getType, and loadExperiment/loadFeatures with PeakFileOptions/FeatureFileOptions. Not the complete MzMLFile, MzMLHandler or FileHandler API.",
